#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:1
#: 6b821fb2dcc04cc98a43dae23945c662
msgid "快速开始"
msgstr "Quick start"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:3
#: b722a8fdd62b4b9e8f43ae7ed8e4916f
msgid ""
"这页只做一件事：从安装到生成第一批候选结构。跑通以后，再去看完整清洗流程和每"
"张卡片的参数。"
msgstr ""
"This page takes you from installation to a first set of candidate "
"structures. Once that path works, continue with the full cleaning workflow "
"and the parameter reference for individual cards."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:5
#: 5db75a0c5e154049b3dfd05dc10e93ff
msgid ""
"如果软件已经能正常启动，你只是想查某个页面的按钮或参数，不必从头阅读本页，直"
"接进入 [功能指南](module/index.rst)。功能指南按桌面软件页面顺序组织。"
msgstr "If the application already starts normally and you only need to look up a button or parameter, you do not need to read this page from the beginning. Go straight to the [Feature Guide](module/index.rst), which follows the order of the desktop interface."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:8
#: cc8a905146664257903d443e49c5629c
msgid "1. 安装"
msgstr "1. Install NepTrainKit"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:10
#: cdfb3b025bc6473885d941f5ebeb94e0
msgid "建议使用独立环境，Python 版本用 3.10 到 3.13。"
msgstr "Use an isolated environment with Python 3.10 through 3.13."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:12
#: f5e0b8fe048c4777aa508f5aa75771bf
msgid ""
"conda create -n nepkit python=3.10\n"
"conda activate nepkit\n"
"pip install NepTrainKit\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:18
#: 75ae6177feef4a598a96e2d585b733c5
msgid ""
"NepTrainKit 会安装独立的 `nep-adapters` 运行时。macOS 和 Windows wheel 提供 "
"CPU；Linux x86_64 wheel 同时提供 CPU 和 CUDA。安装 wheel 不要求本机安装 CUDA "
"Toolkit 或 NVCC，但 CUDA 计算需要兼容的 NVIDIA 驱动。"
msgstr ""
"NepTrainKit installs the separate `nep-adapters` runtime. The macOS and "
"Windows wheels provide CPU support, while the Linux x86_64 wheel provides "
"both CPU and CUDA. Installing a wheel does not require a local CUDA Toolkit "
"or NVCC, but CUDA calculations require a compatible NVIDIA driver."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:20
#: 24423749ccb14114bfe5c22cc8c7d42f
msgid "安装后先确认运行时状态："
msgstr "Confirm the runtime status after installation:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:22
#: 373d6278d8b04847a64ed0bd99def3a7
msgid ""
"python -c \"import nep_adapters as n; print(n.backend_status('cpu')); "
"print(n.backend_status('cuda'))\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:26
#: 55b79ada5d074dc6a20ac7b298cb90d5
msgid ""
"如果 `cuda` 显示不可用，NepTrainKit 的 `Auto` 模式会说明原因并使用 CPU。只有"
"在必须使用 CUDA 时才明确选择 `CUDA`；不可用时程序会直接报错。"
msgstr ""
"If `cuda` is unavailable, NepTrainKit's `Auto` mode explains why and uses "
"the CPU. Select `CUDA` explicitly only when CUDA is required; the "
"application will report an error if it is unavailable."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:28
#: 989355261ca74270b0263e310843020b
msgid "启动软件："
msgstr "Launch the application:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:30
#: eedb5e525be4400b93d12b41bc93dcc3
msgid "nepkit\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:34
#: 1e5679305b674fdfb34f8689b2a5be26
msgid "2. 打开 生成数据集"
msgstr "2. Open Make Dataset"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:36
#: e6dd9fb62c554a53bcf05fdbc7adaa1d
msgid ""
"第一次建议从 `生成数据集` 开始。它的职责是制作训练集候选结构：输入一批基础结"
"构， 选择一张或多张卡片，生成应变、扰动、缺陷、表面、掺杂或磁性构型。"
msgstr "For your first run, start with `Make Dataset`. Its role is to create candidate structures for a training set: load a group of base structures, choose one or more cards, and generate strained, perturbed, defective, surface, doped, or magnetic configurations."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:39
#: c764b5f261ed4de5ba7c4a0049ac40ac
msgid ""
"切到 `生成数据集` 后，先点击窗口顶部的 `Open` 按钮导入初始结构。这里的初始结"
"构 通常是已经弛豫好的 `xyz`、`extxyz`、`POSCAR` 或 `CIF` 文件；后面的卡片都会"
"以这批结构 作为输入继续生成候选构型。"
msgstr "After switching to `Make Dataset`, click `Open` at the top of the window to import the starting structures. These are usually relaxed `xyz`, `extxyz`, `POSCAR`, or `CIF` files. The cards that follow use this set of structures as their input and generate candidate configurations."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:43
#: afd959c5fddd4549a2f2261d7708e8b7
msgid "生成数据集 empty workspace"
msgstr "Empty Make Dataset workspace"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:43
#: afd959c5fddd4549a2f2261d7708e8b7
msgid ".. image:: _static/image/generated/make_data_empty.png"
msgstr ".. image:: _static/image/generated/make_data_empty.png"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:48
#: 692039a5bc6f4f4593f1911071b60e3d
msgid "图中需要记住四个位置："
msgstr "Remember these four areas:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:50
#: 9ae5b6d11740451d8a51664f3c417564
msgid ""
"`Open input structures`：导入初始结构。没有输入结构时，多数生成卡片没有可处理"
"对象。"
msgstr ""
"`Open input structures`: import the starting structures. Most generation "
"cards have nothing to process until an input has been loaded."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:51
#: 8cd7f3998f3045e1814c1c266f6be106
msgid "`Add new card`：添加构型生成或筛选卡片。"
msgstr "`Add new card`: add a structure-generation or filtering operation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:52
#: 75a3076678a14398b2c39bd631553c8f
msgid "`Run selected cards`：只运行已勾选的卡片。"
msgstr "`Run selected cards`: run only the cards that are currently selected."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:53
#: 41f365c8f5d845bba5bbfe1589711ee7
msgid ""
"`Workflow workspace`：卡片会按顺序放在这里，后续也在这里检查结果和导出。"
msgstr ""
"`Workflow workspace`: cards appear here in execution order; use the same "
"area to inspect and export their results."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:55
#: 3e7232b2bf6340db9f12d9856300da2b
msgid "3. 生成一组候选结构"
msgstr "3. Generate a candidate set"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:57
#: 08de553f77bb4b92936d3b020f486cc7
msgid ""
"这里用“晶格应变（`Lattice Strain`）”作为第一张卡。它的输入是已有结构，输出是"
"一组晶格被拉伸或压缩后的结构。 这一步得到的是候选结构，不是最终训练集。"
msgstr "We use “Lattice Strain” as the first card. It takes existing structures as input and outputs structures with expanded or compressed cells. The result is a candidate set, not the final training set."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:60
#: 940b98ad65154e46a2cb7c115ec8ad73
msgid "先用 `Open` 导入初始结构。"
msgstr "Import a starting structure with `Open`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:61
#: 5bebf626b62f4b6e9f7a96da054315cf
msgid "点击 `Add new card`。"
msgstr "Click `Add new card`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:62
#: 2de8e08cb5a8493bbdd796fb93ad9204
msgid "选择“晶格应变（`Lattice Strain`）”。"
msgstr "Choose “Lattice Strain”."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:63
#: 55f02d60614e43138fc5df86fe521d07
msgid "设置一个小范围，例如 X/Y/Z 都从 `-2%` 到 `2%`，步长 `1%`。"
msgstr ""
"Use a small initial range, for example `-2%` to `2%` along X, Y, and Z with "
"a `1%` step."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:64
#: 96bce8da91ed4cf8ae97bd1e71bcda46
msgid "勾选这张卡，点击顶部 `Run`。"
msgstr "Select the card and click `Run` in the title bar."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:65
#: 7f5319e5b470470b8d14031376aec90e
msgid "运行完成后，从卡片上的导出按钮保存结果。"
msgstr ""
"When the run finishes, save the result with the export button on the card."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:67
#: 2d7835e0e0a34a13a1efd068ffc4b47d
msgid "晶格应变卡片快速上手"
msgstr "Lattice Strain card quick start"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:67
#: 2d7835e0e0a34a13a1efd068ffc4b47d
msgid ".. image:: _static/image/generated/make_data_lattice_strain.png"
msgstr ".. image:: _static/image/generated/make_data_lattice_strain.png"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:72
#: adce71f6860a455d920b816c284f85c7
msgid "这张图对应的使用逻辑是："
msgstr "The workflow illustrated above is deliberate:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:74
#: d158b3bb43ff44c9aa155d7ba65a38c9
msgid "先添加卡片，不要一开始就改很多高级参数。"
msgstr "Add the card first; do not begin by changing every advanced option."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:75
#: 1a64673accd64e7abf23c7d2eb9ace6b
msgid "只改与物理目标直接相关的范围，例如应变轴、最小值、最大值、步长。"
msgstr ""
"Change only the ranges tied directly to the physical objective, such as the "
"strain axes, minimum, maximum, and step."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:76
#: 1c528850af974b6abb7dcbd3b39a48bb
msgid "运行后先看输出数量是否符合预期，再导出到下一步检查。"
msgstr ""
"Check that the output count is plausible before exporting the structures for "
"inspection."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:78
#: f58244cb8489449a8dcf8de9550d97d7
msgid "4. 检查候选结构"
msgstr "Step 4: Inspect the candidates"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:80
#: 361ac769d6844483b716aa31e2afdc9a
msgid "`生成数据集` 生成的是候选结构，不建议默认直接送 DFT。最短检查路径是："
msgstr "`Make Dataset` produces candidate structures, which should not normally be sent directly to DFT. The shortest inspection path is:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:82
#: 1f4128ff73554b608d5ad2cf1c235588
msgid "NEP Dataset Display overview"
msgstr "NEP Dataset Display overview"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:82
#: 1f4128ff73554b608d5ad2cf1c235588
msgid ".. image:: _static/image/generated/show_nep_overview.png"
msgstr ".. image:: _static/image/generated/show_nep_overview.png"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:87
#: 516ab4b9501b476db52987911627bf1e
msgid "在 `NEP Dataset Display` 打开候选结构。"
msgstr "Open the candidates in `NEP Dataset Display`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:88
#: 8accad106cc64ce4959e51544b49f7ed
msgid "先看结构和明显异常点。"
msgstr "Inspect the structures and the most obvious outliers first."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:89
#: 126dde46627b4578acdd7390d853a130
msgid "删除或单独导出异常样本。"
msgstr ""
"Delete problematic samples or export them separately for investigation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:90
#: 2187d5b7f89d4a9fbfb213ee22cdd990
msgid "清洗后再决定是否做 FPS 代表性采样。"
msgstr "After cleaning, decide whether representative FPS sampling is needed."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:92
#: d4d0909361ae49a2bd374ca3fa2af4a3
msgid "5. 进入 DFT 和训练"
msgstr "Step 5: Continue to DFT and training"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:94
#: f193e48c02d640649766165fc71aa511
msgid ""
"清洗后的结构再送去做第一性原理计算。DFT 标注完成后，用 GPUMD 训练 NEP； 训练"
"结束后，再回到 `NEP Dataset Display` 查看训练误差。"
msgstr ""
"Send the cleaned structures to first-principles calculations. Once DFT "
"labels are available, train the NEP model with GPUMD. Return to `NEP Dataset "
"Display` after training to inspect the errors."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:97
#: 77205661b8b44a159998d73f8ada968a
msgid ""
"完整的清洗顺序、为什么不要先 FPS、以及如何用 NEP 预测做预筛，见 [候选结构清洗"
"后再进入 DFT](workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See [Clean candidate structures before DFT](workflows/clean-candidate-"
"structures.md) for the complete order of operations, why FPS should not come "
"first, and how to use NEP predictions for prescreening."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:100
#: 92c92c6e76ca41d5b5f65ee408b417b0
msgid ""
"如果你在做缺陷、表面、掺杂或磁性结构，直接去看 [生成数据集卡片手册](module/"
"make-dataset-cards/index.md)。手册按卡片用途组织，比逐个试菜单更快。"
msgstr "If you are creating defect, surface, doped, or magnetic structures, go directly to the [Make Dataset card manual](module/make-dataset-cards/index.md). It is organized by purpose, which is faster than trying cards one by one from the menu."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/quickstart.md:102
#: 979f8cf081404bd1b5f15668a8542ec3
msgid ""
"如果你要从标准晶体开始，而不是导入已有结构，可以先用 `Crystal Prototype "
"Builder` 生成 `fcc`、`bcc`、`hcp` 或 `fcc111` 原型。需要扫 fcc (111) 的 GSFE "
"路径时，先生成 `fcc111` 原型，再接 `Stacking Fault / GSFE Path`；不要把普通 "
"cubic `fcc` cell 直接拿去扫 `(111)`。"
msgstr "If you are starting from a standard crystal instead of importing an existing structure, use `Crystal Prototype Builder` to create an `fcc`, `bcc`, `hcp`, or `fcc111` prototype. For an fcc (111) GSFE path, generate the `fcc111` prototype first and then add `Stacking Fault / GSFE Path`; do not use a regular cubic `fcc` cell directly for a `(111)` scan."

